= API Stability =
There is no API version number and not even non-binding guarantees about API stability are being made.

For example the {{project_name_short}} stable version number comes from [[Template:VersionNew]], which existed anyhow prior to any API request.

= API Completeness =
Other information might already be available (since the wiki or forum software has these features anyhow). Please ask in forums.

= API v2 =
Recommended. Clean endpoints that return the bare value only, with nothing to strip:

* stable version number: <code>/wiki/api/version-stable</code>
* testers version number: <code>/wiki/api/version-testers</code>
* onion domain: <code>/wiki/api/www-onion</code>
* clearnet domain: <code>/wiki/api/www-clearnet</code>

= API v1 =
Legacy. MediaWiki <code>action=raw</code> endpoints. Their result has a trailing <code><nowiki><noinclude>[[Category:MultiWiki]]</noinclude></nowiki></code> which must be searched and replaced with nothing; API v2 above avoids this.

== VirtualBox Stable Version Number ==
* https://www.{{project_clearnet}}/w/index.php?title=Template:VersionNew&stable=0&action=raw
* http://www.{{project_onion}}/w/index.php?title=Template:VersionNew&stable=0&action=raw

== VirtualBox Testers-Only Version Number ==
* https://www.{{project_clearnet}}/w/index.php?title=Template:VersionTesters&stable=0&action=raw
* http://www.{{project_onion}}/w/index.php?title=Template:VersionTesters&stable=0&action=raw

== KVM Stable Version Number ==
* https://www.{{project_clearnet}}/w/index.php?title=Template:Version_KVM&stable=0&action=raw
* http://www.{{project_onion}}/w/index.php?title=Template:Version_KVM&stable=0&action=raw

== Onion-Location ==
The onion domain for <code>{{project_clearnet}}</code>:
* https://www.{{project_clearnet}}/w/index.php?title=Template:Project_onion&action=raw
* http://www.{{project_onion}}/w/index.php?title=Template:Project_onion&action=raw

= Note =
This is not a real (dynamic) API. The API v2 endpoints are plain static files generated at build time from the wiki version templates; they change only when the website is rebuilt.

